{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_01",
      "hash": "6377cae5824865b1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "???: So!\\nYou defeated Archer..."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_02",
      "hash": "6377c7e582486098",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I must say—I am impressed you got here."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_05",
      "hash": "6377cee582486c7d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Team Rocket captures Pokémon from around\\nthe world.\\c\\nThey’re important tools for keeping our criminal\\nenterprise going."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_06",
      "hash": "6377cbe582486764",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "And I am the leader of this enterprise...Giovanni!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_12",
      "hash": "637b51e5824b80ed",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "...What? You want me to release the Cubone?"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0740_karakara_01",
      "hash": "23dd5c22364b2f1e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "CUBONE: Maaa maaa!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_13",
      "hash": "637b50e5824b7f3a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GIOVANNI: Fwahahahaha!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_14",
      "hash": "637b4be5824b76bb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You came barging into our hideout just for that?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_15",
      "hash": "637b4ae5824b7508",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "What an amusing child."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_07",
      "hash": "6377cce582486917",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "But...\\nFor your insolence, you will feel a world of pain!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0740_dummy_01",
      "hash": "25781b19f3783aea",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 10]"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_03",
      "hash": "6377c8e58248624b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GIOVANNI: So I too am defeated by a child..."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_16",
      "hash": "637b4de5824b7a21",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Do as you wish with that Cubone."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0740_karakara_02",
      "hash": "23dd5b22364b2d6b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "CUBONE: Maaa!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_08",
      "hash": "6377c1e582485666",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "And take this.\\nAs my apology for mocking you as a child."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0740_sys_01",
      "hash": "cf2789eaf3ba5b91",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Giovanni handed you the [VAR COLOR(0006)]Silph Scope[VAR COLOR(0000)]!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_04",
      "hash": "6377cde582486aca",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "...I can see you raise Pokémon with utmost care."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_09",
      "hash": "6377c2e582485819",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "But you would never understand what\\nI hope to achieve."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_10",
      "hash": "637b4fe5824b7d87",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "... ... ...\\nI shall step aside this time!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_11",
      "hash": "637b4ee5824b7bd4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "But I hope we will meet and battle again!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main0740_karakara_03",
      "hash": "23dd5a22364b2bb8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "CUBONE: Maaa maff!"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_main0740_sys_02",
      "hash": "cf2786eaf3ba5678",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Cubone headed back to [VAR COLOR(0006)]Lavender Town[VAR COLOR(0000)]."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_main0740_sys_03",
      "hash": "cf2787eaf3ba582b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Maybe with the Silph Scope, you’ll be able to\\nfind out the identity of that [VAR COLOR(0006)]ghost[VAR COLOR(0000)]...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketchief_01",
      "hash": "931be10778a8be15",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "ARCHER: ...Cubone seems to have gone home\\non its own.\\c\\nWhy don’t you get out of here, too, and try to\\nfigure out how to use that Silph Scope\\r\\nor something?"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0740_max",
      "hash": "0ac7d547bdee57fe"
    }
  ]
}
